      "text": "A hyperbola with each semi-axis <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "A circle of radius <math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
